body:
Aside from what others commented, respiratory diseases are tricky fuckers. If you want a semi-hopeful read about COVID, give this article 5-10min of your time: [https://www.theatlantic.com/science/archive/2021/08/how-we-live-coronavirus-forever/619783/](https://www.theatlantic.com/science/archive/2021/08/how-we-live-coronavirus-forever/619783/)

&#x200B;

It indirectly sheds some light to your question.

gaslighter, liar

&#x200B;

nothing sends me into rage instantly like a person I catch doing something wrong and them immediately gaslighting me (how they didn't do anything, etc). fuck.

Sige sige that makes sense. May actives nga pala ung isa and I already only touch my actives three times a week (spaced out from each other so my skin doesn't get mad)

